Z||000000||GarethWright||07-07-2001||02:45 AM||||Hello everybody,<BR>I race RC Cars on the weekend (electric touring) and at the minute I have a Stratus body, which looks nice, but Forever ago on Ebay I saw a Fiero GTP RC Body which I now realize I MUST HAVE.  If any of you have ANY idea who makes (made?) that body or how to get hold of one, I would really like to know.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Gareth||||reg||1
