Z||000003||fierobaby||07-07-2001||12:51 PM||||Yes the body was made by Bolink great company by the way but they have discontuniued it. I at one time had the Fiero body but got into a mjor wreck and the body cracked and I never thought it would be anything I would want in the futer! heck I was only like 10 or 11 I wish I had never ruined that body! :-( I'll keep my eyes out for the body for you guys. my dad is friends with a guy who runs a hobby shop so He knows about all the stuff like that I'll talk to him soon and see what he knows about the body<P>------------------<BR>1984 Sweet Candy Apple red Fiero sport coupe :-D<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||6
Z||000004||Terrybogin||07-07-2001||07:07 PM||||Traxxas made the best looking Fiero GTP 1/12 scale bodies. I don't know about 1/10 scale though.||||reg||1
